            "review_title": "Review at Long’s Smoke House",
            "review_text": "Mark C\nCan Tho, Vietnam\n51 contributions\n2\nBeef eating extravaganza!!!\nNov 2019\nI’ve been following this guy on Facebook for sometime and I finally got to try his food at an international food festival in Saigon. It was amazing! I ate 900 grams of beef rib and it was so good I still wanted more. It’s as good as anything I’ve had anywhere in the world. This place is take-away only but the deliver too. You can only buy it by the pound so you need some friends. It’s not cheap but it’s worth it.\nWritten November 20, 2019",
